{"v":4,"catch":"《奧雷薩之下》(Beneath Oresa)是一款類Rogue的卡牌架構遊戲。","desc":"玩家將在城市深處的格鬥競技場迎戰敵人。身兼戰略家與戰士的你，必須謹慎地挑選卡牌、升級與神器，還要拿捏好與敵人的距離，在正確時機與敵方交手，並利用敵方位置取得相對優勢。這款節奏明快的遊戲中有許多派系、各具不同能力的英雄、每日任務、特殊遊戲機制等，結合了類Rogue與策略元素，將帶你深入探索奧雷薩之下。","publisher":"Goblinz Studio","release":"2024-09-12","genres":["策略"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 2.2GB / Switch 2.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/308f1ce8c31e71f4c023f24040d559994c3aff2e15f90173db8eac1f9fc7238b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/99be55a05aca232f9cb21aab3ba6e180da3984fd5ad5cdc52fb4f12bca0623b9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9241eaa13615f481353b53507c2e881befcc069f4b3f6b73ae25372f00d7ad72.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/179ab920178d48c4e0de593b281ed3a3163c31375513a3c81ee4b21b87867146.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ef92290c402264afd95c93c0e180c2f8f044043e02607445eb01dc609bb409be.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6cd20743c432be3761dc749b95966677ce8ba3320ed86b2de11609c7db9d7d4d.jpg"],"titleId":"010028001f2d4000","dlc":[]}